(text "U3 input directly at C22 (no stub).\nSAMPLE_OUT to an ADC that converts once per strobe (ADC_CLK)." (at 416.56 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1cb5830d-84af-5fa0-8769-97e26674fb8e))
(text "STROBE DRIVER (low cost)  -  PLL CMOS output -> two saturating MMIC stages -> clip stub -> common-mode choke as balun.\nUnproven: needs an edge under about 120 ps and 2 V at CLIP (simulated: 71 ps sampler with a 160 ps pulse).  L3 pin numbers are placeholders." (at 350.52 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 28f513e0-0578-520d-9104-00004505040b))
