(text "CLK0 strobe f_s      CLK1 ADC clock f_s (MCU ADC trigger)\nCLK2 calibrator / TDR step f_sig      CLK3 f_sig to MCU (time zero)\nI2C pull-ups at the MCU.  CMOS outputs, about 1 ns edges: the MMIC stages do the sharpening." (at 25.4 332.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e1d35d4-b8ec-58aa-8707-fccb852f8a84))
