(text "NOTES\n1. Concept schematic for docs/scope-frontend.md. Values in the input stage are from the jmw active probe; the rest are first estimates.\n2. Supplies +5 V, -5 V, +3.3 V, +1.8 V come from off-sheet regulators (reference design: LTC3261 + TPS7A39 for the split rails).\n3. Off-sheet: MCU (SPI, PLL control), DACs (VOFS, VCLH, VCLL, VBIAS_A, VBIAS_K, TRIG_LEVEL), ADC (SAMPLE_OUT, ADC_CLK).\n4. Pin numbers read from datasheets: BUF802, ADCMP572, GVA-84+, OPA656, Si5344 (signal pins). Not verified: T1, Y1, OPA140 (standard\n   SOIC-8 assumed), BAT15-04W (as on the yanartas board: 1 anode, 2 cathode, 3 common), Si5344 supply pin grouping.\n5. Low-cost variant: see docs/scope-frontend.md, section Cost-down. OPA197, OPA810 and BAT54S pinouts assumed standard; L3 pins are placeholders." (at 480 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 28446a5f-19b7-571e-af84-236a8152ad27))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
